; easy TRAP: UPPER can change the character count (straße -> STRASSE), so LEFT(UPPER(s)) != UPPER(LEFT(s)) (S6); label built before the c_credit filter can move after it
LOAD   nm, customers.c_name
LOAD   cr, customers.c_credit
LOAD   id, customers.c_id
UPPER  u, nm
LEFT   l, u, 4
LEN    n, l
GT     m, cr, 2000.00
IDX    i, m
GATHER a, id, i
GATHER b, l, i
GATHER c, n, i
OUT    a, b, c
